{"id":"659948","name":"腊肉炒菌菇","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659948/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腊肉","amount":"一块"},{"name":"鹿茸菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"两个"},{"name":"螺丝椒","amount":"一个"},{"name":"大蒜瓣","amount":"3个"},{"name":"葱","amount":"一小把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腊肉煮一下清洗干净。","img":"images/659948/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鹿茸菇浸泡。","img":"images/659948/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"所需食材改刀备用。","img":"images/659948/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"菌菇清洗控水。","img":"images/659948/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里倒入适量的油，把蒜，葱白，辣椒煸炒出香味。","img":"images/659948/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入腊肉翻炒出香味。","img":"images/659948/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入菌菇继续翻炒。","img":"images/659948/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋入料酒。","img":"images/659948/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"生抽。","img":"images/659948/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"鸡精翻炒均匀。","img":"images/659948/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅前放入葱段和螺丝椒翻炒断生即可出锅。","img":"images/659948/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}